sequenceDiagram
    participant CR as Critic Agent
    participant PCTR as pCTR Scorer
    participant VAD as VADER Scorer
    participant BERT as BERTScore Scorer
    participant NLI as NLI Scorer (bart-large-mnli)

    loop for each of 5 TitleCandidates
        CR->>PCTR: score_title(title, category_id)
        PCTR-->>CR: pctr_score
        CR->>VAD: compound(title)
        VAD-->>CR: vader_compound
        CR->>BERT: bert_similarity(title, core_promise)
        BERT-->>CR: bert_similarity
        CR->>NLI: classify(premise=title, hypothesis=core_promise)
        NLI-->>CR: entailment | neutral | contradiction

        alt NLI label = contradiction
            CR->>CR: is_valid = False
            CR->>CR: append to rejection_log
            CR->>CR: composite_score = 0 (nli_multiplier = 0)
        else entailment or neutral
            CR->>CR: is_valid = True
            CR->>CR: composite_score = 0.50·pCTR + 0.25·|VADER| + 0.25·BERTScore
        end
    end

    CR->>CR: top_title = argmax(composite_score) over valid candidates only
